WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.624
LAST_VALUE often surprises students The function
does

00:00:05.637 --> 00:00:11.189
not automatically look to the final row of the
partition It returns

00:00:11.215 --> 00:00:16.913
the last value in the current frame With the default
ordered frame that

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:22.531
frame commonly ends at the current peer group If you
want the final value

00:00:22.557 --> 00:00:26.755
across the entire partition make the frame extend
through unbounded following
